WEBVTT

00:00:00.224 --> 00:00:06.760
Wait, are you sure you want to come with me?
It costs 2.4 million dollars, Marcus.

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:11.520
I told her not to open the door, but she did anyway.

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:15.360
The meeting starts at 9.30 on Tuesday morning.

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:19.220
And I was like, no way, that can't be true.

00:00:20.704 --> 00:00:23.240
So he left the building before anyone noticed.

00:00:24.768 --> 00:00:27.340
Did you really think I wouldn't find out?

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.920
300 people showed up to the event last night.

